WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.133
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.133 --> 00:10.933
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.933 --> 00:12.400
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.400 --> 00:14.567
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.400
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.400 --> 00:19.500
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.500 --> 00:21.500
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.500 --> 00:23.400
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.400 --> 00:25.033
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.533
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.533 --> 00:29.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.367 --> 00:31.467
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.467 --> 00:33.500
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.500 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.633
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.633 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.833 --> 00:45.567
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.567 --> 00:47.300
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.300 --> 00:49.400
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.700 --> 00:54.700
[light music]
[轻音乐]

00:54.700 --> 01:00.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:00.067 --> 01:01.433
[bubbles popping]
[气泡破裂]

01:01.433 --> 01:03.733
- News flash!
A severe rip current
- 新闻快讯！
严重的离岸电流

01:03.733 --> 01:06.400
may soon touch down
in Bikini Bottom.
可能很快就会着陆
在比基尼底部。

01:06.400 --> 01:08.433
Residents are warned
to bar all windows
居民被警告
禁止所有窗口

01:08.433 --> 01:09.667
and stay indoors.
并留在室内。

01:09.667 --> 01:11.800
[hammering]
[锤击]

01:11.800 --> 01:13.367
[cow moos]
[牛哞哞]

01:13.367 --> 01:16.933
Save yourselves!
救救你们自己吧！

01:16.933 --> 01:19.133
- Ahh, rip current,
schmip current.
- 啊，离岸流，
施米普电流。

01:19.133 --> 01:20.533
'Tain't nothing.
“没什么。”

01:22.067 --> 01:24.167
- Gee, Mr. Krabs,
do you think the rip current
- 哎呀，蟹老板先生，
你认为离岸流

01:24.167 --> 01:25.600
will hit the Krusty Krab?
会击中蟹堡王吗？

01:25.600 --> 01:27.800
Ahh!
[imitates explosion, splashing]
啊！
【模拟爆炸、飞溅】

01:27.800 --> 01:31.267
[screaming,
explosion noises]
[尖叫，
爆炸声]

01:31.267 --> 01:33.233
- Uh, shouldn't we
clear the docks?
- 呃，我们不应该吗
清理码头？

01:33.233 --> 01:35.067
Or batten down the patches?
还是把补丁打平？

01:35.067 --> 01:37.167
Or whatever people say?
还是人家说啥就啥？

01:37.167 --> 01:38.633
- Calm your waters!
- 平静你的水域！

01:38.633 --> 01:42.067
Me sailor's knee
says we're not in danger, see?
我水手的膝盖
说我们没有危险，明白吗？

01:42.067 --> 01:43.067
[whistling, ticking]
[口哨声，滴答声]

01:43.067 --> 01:45.067
Now, get back to work!
现在，回去工作吧！

01:45.067 --> 01:47.067
- Excuse me, are we in
any kind of peril?
- 打扰一下，我们在吗？
有什么危险吗？

01:47.067 --> 01:48.600
- I think we should
all go home.
- 我认为我们应该
都回家吧。

01:48.600 --> 01:52.133
- As soon as you buy some
Patties to go, you can go.
- 一旦你买了一些
肉饼要走了，你可以走了。

01:52.133 --> 01:53.133
- I'll have three
Krabby Patties.
- 我要三个
蟹肉饼。

01:53.133 --> 01:54.733
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

01:54.733 --> 01:57.200
On second thought,
cancel that order!
再一想，
取消该订单！

01:57.200 --> 01:59.867
- No takey-backsees!
Three Krabby Patties.
- 没有收回！
三个蟹肉饼。

01:59.867 --> 02:01.467
[buzzing]
[gasps]
[嗡嗡声]
[喘气]

02:01.467 --> 02:04.533
Me money detector!
Where do you think you're going?
我的金钱探测器！
你认为你要去哪里？

02:04.533 --> 02:06.600
Get back in there
and spend the rest
回到那里
并度过剩下的时间

02:06.600 --> 02:09.967
of your money!
- But I needed it for rent.
你的钱！
- 但我需要它来出租。

02:09.967 --> 02:13.467
- Listen up, everybody!
New store policy:
- 大家听着！
新店政策：

02:13.467 --> 02:15.567
all money
brought into this store
所有的钱
带进这家店

02:15.567 --> 02:17.667
must be spent here.
一定要在这里度过。

02:17.667 --> 02:19.400
- Tyrant!
- 暴君！

02:19.400 --> 02:21.667
- Oh! Tyrant am I?
- 哦！我是暴君吗？

02:21.667 --> 02:24.600
All right,
I'm a tyrant!
好吧，
我是暴君！

02:24.600 --> 02:26.900
The worst in all
the seven seas.
最糟糕的
七大洋。

02:26.900 --> 02:28.967
What of it?
[growls]
那又怎样呢？
[咆哮]

02:28.967 --> 02:31.567
- Hey, why's Mr. Krabs
so crabby today?
- 嘿，为什么是蟹老板
今天这么暴躁吗？

02:31.567 --> 02:33.767
- Probably because
it's payday.
- 可能是因为
今天是发薪日。

02:33.767 --> 02:35.833
- Payday's been canceled!
[feedback squeals]
- 发薪日已取消！
[反馈尖叫声]

02:35.833 --> 02:39.133
Now hear this!
I'm the captain of this ship!
现在听听这个！
我是这艘船的船长！

02:39.133 --> 02:40.433
Captain Krabs!
蟹老板！

02:40.433 --> 02:43.100
And I say no rip current
我说没有离岸电流

02:43.100 --> 02:45.367
will ever harm
the Krusty Krab!
永远会伤害
蟹堡王！

02:45.367 --> 02:46.667
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

02:46.667 --> 02:48.967
[crashing]
[chains rattle]
[崩溃]
[链条嘎嘎作响]

02:48.967 --> 02:50.067
[screaming]
[尖叫]

02:50.067 --> 02:53.933
[all screaming]
[crashing]
[所有人尖叫]
[崩溃]

02:53.933 --> 02:56.233
[yelling]
[大喊]

02:56.233 --> 02:59.133
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:59.133 --> 03:01.133
[wood creaks]
[木头吱吱作响]

03:01.133 --> 03:02.267
[thud]
[砰]

03:02.267 --> 03:03.533
[crashing]
[崩溃]

03:03.533 --> 03:08.067
[pained groan]
[痛苦的呻吟]

03:08.067 --> 03:09.067
[duck quacks]
[鸭子嘎嘎叫]

03:09.067 --> 03:10.433
- Darn arthritis.
- 该死的关节炎。

03:10.433 --> 03:12.133
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

03:12.133 --> 03:13.667
[chains rattle]
[链条嘎嘎作响]

03:13.667 --> 03:15.633
[yelling]
[grunting]
[大喊]
[咕噜声]

03:15.633 --> 03:20.167
[all screaming,
whimpering]
[大家尖叫，
呜咽]

03:20.167 --> 03:21.533
- [growls]
Hm.
- [咆哮]
嗯。

03:21.533 --> 03:24.633
[thrilling music]
[key jangles]
[惊心动魄的音乐]
[关键铃声]

03:24.633 --> 03:25.433
Yah.
嗯。

03:25.433 --> 03:29.467
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:29.467 --> 03:31.900
Yah!
Wah!
啊！
哇！

03:31.900 --> 03:36.600
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:36.600 --> 03:37.633
[straining effort]
[用力]

03:37.633 --> 03:39.667
[popping]
- Ah!
[爆裂声]
- 啊！

03:39.667 --> 03:40.933
- Squidward,
while I steer,
- 章鱼哥，
当我驾驶时，

03:40.933 --> 03:43.133
you tell everyone
we're safe.
你告诉大家
我们很安全。

03:43.133 --> 03:45.067
- It's all right now,
everybody.
- 现在没事了
大家。

03:45.067 --> 03:49.300
- Everything's under control
now and whatever.
- 一切尽在掌握
现在以及无论如何。

03:49.300 --> 03:51.633
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

03:51.633 --> 03:53.633
- Three cheers
for Squidward!
- 三声欢呼
为了章鱼哥！

03:53.633 --> 03:55.767
- The guy who saved
our lives.
- 拯救的人
我们的生活。

03:55.767 --> 03:57.967
- Let's make him
our new captain.
- 让我们让他
我们的新队长。

03:57.967 --> 03:59.067
- Hip, hip--
- 臀部，臀部--

03:59.067 --> 04:01.600
all: Hooray for
Captain Squidward!
全部： 万岁
章鱼哥船长！

04:01.600 --> 04:03.267
- Congratulations,
Squidward.
- 恭喜，
章鱼哥。

04:03.267 --> 04:06.667
Oh, I mean
Captain Squidward.
哦，我是说
章鱼哥船长。

04:06.667 --> 04:08.133
- What's the meaning
of this?
- 是什么意思
这个？

04:08.133 --> 04:11.067
- What should we do with this
tyrant, Captain Squidward?
- 我们应该用这个做什么
暴君，章鱼哥船长？

04:11.067 --> 04:12.333
- Captain Squidward?
- 章鱼哥队长？

04:12.333 --> 04:13.500
- Let's flog him!
- 我们来鞭打他吧！

04:13.500 --> 04:14.633
all: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

04:14.633 --> 04:16.533
- Let's tie him
to the mast!
- 我们把他绑起来
到桅杆！

04:16.533 --> 04:17.767
all: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

04:17.767 --> 04:19.167
- Let's put
the past behind us
- 让我们把
过去在我们身后

04:19.167 --> 04:20.433
and start all over!
一切从头开始！

04:20.433 --> 04:21.767
all: No!
全体：不！

04:21.767 --> 04:24.833
- This is mutiny!
Listen here, Squidward.
- 这是叛变！
听着，章鱼哥。

04:24.833 --> 04:27.433
Fun is fun,
but get me out of here!
好玩就是好玩，
但带我离开这里！

04:27.433 --> 04:29.867
- Sorry, I don't think
that's a captain's job.
- 抱歉，我不认为
这是队长的工作。

04:29.867 --> 04:31.400
You're on your own.
- Hey, everybody,
你只能靠你自己了。
- 嘿，大家，

04:31.400 --> 04:33.133
can we take a time out?
我们可以抽出时间吗？

04:33.133 --> 04:35.267
This is Mr. Krabs
we're talking about.
这是蟹老板
我们正在谈论。

04:35.267 --> 04:37.767
The worst tyrant
in the seven seas.
最坏的暴君
在七大洋中。

04:37.767 --> 04:39.533
- You're not helping, boy.
- 你没有帮忙，孩子。

04:39.533 --> 04:40.933
- You remember Mr. Krabs.
- 你还记得蟹老板。

04:40.933 --> 04:42.300
He's the man
who brought you
他就是那个男人
谁带你来的

04:42.300 --> 04:43.600
the Krabby Patty!
[bell dings]
蟹肉饼！
[铃声]

04:43.600 --> 04:45.733
[all agreeing]
[全部同意]

04:45.733 --> 04:48.433
And he's the man who brought you
the double Krabby Patty.
他就是那个把你带来的人
双克拉比帕蒂。

04:48.433 --> 04:49.800
And the Krabby Patty
with Cheese.
还有蟹黄饼
与奶酪。

04:49.800 --> 04:51.067
- [yells]
- And the Bratty Patty
- [大喊]
- 还有顽皮的帕蒂

04:51.067 --> 04:53.667
for kids.
- Um, little help here.
对于孩子们。
- 嗯，没什么帮助。

04:53.667 --> 04:55.933
- He also created
the Chatty Patty for teens.
- 他还创造了
适合青少年的闲聊帕蒂。

04:55.933 --> 04:58.400
And who can forget
the Hatty Patty,
谁能忘记
哈蒂·帕蒂，

04:58.400 --> 05:00.367
the patty you wear
as a hat?
你穿的小馅饼
作为帽子？

05:00.367 --> 05:02.633
- I wear it
because I'm bald.
- 我穿它
因为我是秃头。

05:02.633 --> 05:05.067
- Well, I guess any man
who invented
- 嗯，我想任何人
谁发明的

05:05.067 --> 05:07.567
the Hatty Patty
can't be all bad.
哈蒂·帕蒂
不可能都是坏事。

05:07.567 --> 05:09.133
Okay, let's get him out.
好吧，我们把他弄出去吧。

05:09.133 --> 05:10.167
- Whoa!
- 哇！

05:10.167 --> 05:11.967
Man overboard!
男人落水了！

05:11.967 --> 05:13.533
[yells]
[喊叫]

05:13.533 --> 05:15.267
- No!
- 不！

05:15.267 --> 05:17.100
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

05:17.100 --> 05:19.333
- Well, I guess that solves
that problem.
- 嗯，我想这可以解决
那个问题。

05:19.333 --> 05:21.200
["Taps" playing]
[“点击”播放]

05:21.200 --> 05:23.267
[bites, chews,
swallows]
[咬、咀嚼、
燕子]

05:23.267 --> 05:26.833
- I know you'll come back
to us, Mr. Krabs!
- 我知道你会回来的
给我们，蟹老板！

05:28.300 --> 05:30.300
Until then--
[slurps]
到那时——
[啜饮]

05:30.300 --> 05:32.200
I'll leave a dollar
in the window for you.
我会留下一美元
在窗口为你。

05:32.200 --> 05:35.733
- Hey! It's Captain Squidward's
fault that we lost the man
- 嘿！这是章鱼哥船长的
错的是我们失去了那个人

05:35.733 --> 05:37.467
who invented
the Hatty Patty.
谁发明的
哈蒂·帕蒂。

05:37.467 --> 05:39.667
- Yeah, we're fickle
and we say
- 是的，我们善变
我们说

05:39.667 --> 05:42.467
you're the tyrant now!
all: Yeah!
你现在就是暴君了！
全体：是啊！

05:42.467 --> 05:43.933
Uhh, don't be hasty.
呃，别着急。

05:43.933 --> 05:45.900
Remember, I'm--
I'm still the captain.
请记住，我是——
我还是队长。

05:45.900 --> 05:47.300
The Hatty Patty
was my idea!
哈蒂·帕蒂
是我的主意！

05:47.300 --> 05:49.500
- But we're still stuck
in this rip current!
- 但我们仍然陷入困境
在这撕裂的电流中！

05:49.500 --> 05:51.100
- We'll never get out!
- 我们永远出不去！

05:51.100 --> 05:52.467
- Oh--
[stammers]
- 哦--
[结巴]

05:52.467 --> 05:53.633
Ooh!
[flapping sound, struggles]
哦！
[拍打声，挣扎]

05:53.633 --> 05:55.267
Oh, barnacles!
It--ow--oh, oh!
哦，藤壶！
它——噢——噢，噢！

05:55.267 --> 05:56.267
[metal clanging]
[金属叮当作响]

05:56.267 --> 05:58.667
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

05:58.667 --> 06:01.233
[grunting, crashing]
[咕噜声，崩溃]

06:01.233 --> 06:02.433
[straining]
[紧张]

06:02.433 --> 06:05.433
[screams]
[popping]
[尖叫声]
[爆裂声]

06:05.433 --> 06:07.833
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

06:10.533 --> 06:12.333
[crashing]
[崩溃]

06:12.333 --> 06:14.067
- Uh, We're alive!
- 呃，我们还活着！

06:14.067 --> 06:15.633
Captain Squidward
steered us
章鱼哥船长
引导我们

06:15.633 --> 06:17.067
out of the rip current!
脱离离岸流！

06:17.067 --> 06:19.667
- How 'bout a cheer
for Captain Squidward?
- 欢呼一下怎么样
章鱼哥队长？

06:19.667 --> 06:21.967
[all cheer]
[大家欢呼]

06:21.967 --> 06:26.067
Thank you, thank you.
Just doing my job as captain,
谢谢，谢谢。
只是尽我队长的职责

06:26.067 --> 06:27.633
protecting my crew.
保护我的船员。

06:27.633 --> 06:32.500
- Whoa, where are we?
[all exclaim]
- 哇，我们在哪里？
[所有人惊呼]

06:32.500 --> 06:34.900
- Oh, look at that.
That's amazing.
- 哦，看看那个。
太棒了。

06:34.900 --> 06:37.067
- This neighborhood's crazy.
- 这个街区太疯狂了。

06:37.067 --> 06:38.833
I wonder if there are
any good places to eat.
不知有没有
有什么好吃的地方。

06:38.833 --> 06:40.067
- You think
maybe they've got
- 你认为
也许他们有

06:40.067 --> 06:41.333
a Krusty Krab
around here?
蟹堡王
这附近？

06:41.333 --> 06:42.933
- Hey, good idea.
I could go
- 嘿，好主意。
我可以去

06:42.933 --> 06:44.667
for a Krabby Patty.
- I'm calling
蟹肉饼。
- 我打电话来

06:44.667 --> 06:46.800
the local Krusty Krab
right now.
当地的蟹堡王
现在。

06:46.800 --> 06:49.067
[dial tone, dialing]
[拨号音、拨号]

06:49.067 --> 06:51.467
[phone rings]
- Hello, Krusty Krab.
[电话铃声]
- 你好，蟹堡王。

06:51.467 --> 06:52.633
- Yes, I'd like to
place an order.
- 是的，我愿意
下订单。

06:52.633 --> 06:54.667
- Oh!
[slamming]
- 哦！
[砰]

06:54.667 --> 06:56.500
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

06:56.500 --> 06:58.767
[roaring, crashing]
[all scream]
[咆哮、撞击]
[所有人尖叫]

06:58.767 --> 07:01.133
- Monster! Monster!
- 怪物！怪物！

07:01.133 --> 07:04.067
[roars]
[怒吼]

07:04.067 --> 07:06.900
- Captain!
- You gotta save us.
- 队长！
- 你得救我们。

07:06.900 --> 07:09.067
[squishing]
[groans]
[压扁]
[呻吟]

07:09.067 --> 07:12.733
Ahh!
Captain Squidward!
啊！
章鱼哥船长！

07:15.267 --> 07:18.067
Um, I know where he is.
嗯，我知道他在哪里。

07:18.067 --> 07:20.967
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:23.767 --> 07:24.900
[straining]
Ooh!
[紧张]
哦！

07:24.900 --> 07:26.133
[thud, grunts]
- Uh, Captain,
[重击声，咕噜声]
- 呃，队长，

07:26.133 --> 07:27.767
sorry to interrupt,
but the crew needs you
抱歉打扰，
但船员需要你

07:27.767 --> 07:29.633
to protect them.
- Are you crazy?
保护他们。
- 你疯了？

07:29.633 --> 07:31.233
I can't fight a monster!
我无法与怪物战斗！

07:31.233 --> 07:33.333
- Oh, I'm afraid
the crew insists, sir.
- 哦，我害怕
船员们坚持要求，长官。

07:33.333 --> 07:35.867
[all growling]
[全都咆哮]

07:35.867 --> 07:36.933
[gulps]
[吞咽]

07:36.933 --> 07:37.900
- I don't wanna
be captain!
- 我不想
当队长！

07:37.900 --> 07:39.333
I don't wanna be captain!
我不想当队长！

07:39.333 --> 07:41.367
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

07:41.367 --> 07:43.067
all: [straining effort]
Yah!
全部：[用力]
啊！

07:43.067 --> 07:46.567
- [screams]
- [munches]
- [尖叫]
- [咀嚼]

07:46.567 --> 07:48.267
- Well, that was
anticlimactic.
- 嗯，那是
虎头蛇尾。

07:48.267 --> 07:50.733
- Maybe he'll make
the monster sick.
- 也许他会做
怪物生病了。

07:50.733 --> 07:53.400
- Okay, who had their money on
Captain Squidward?
- 好吧，谁有钱
章鱼哥队长？

07:53.400 --> 07:55.067
Pay up.
付钱吧。

07:55.067 --> 07:57.633
- Well, somebody has to
step up, fight that monster,
- 好吧，总得有人这么做
站起来，对抗那个怪物，

07:57.633 --> 07:58.900
and become captain.
并成为队长。

07:58.900 --> 08:01.133
And that somebody is me!
那个人就是我！

08:01.133 --> 08:02.900
[straining]
[紧张]

08:02.900 --> 08:05.767
[popping]
[breathing heavily]
[爆裂声]
[呼吸粗重]

08:05.767 --> 08:07.133
[breathes, sniffs]
[呼吸，嗅]

08:07.133 --> 08:08.133
[gags]
[笑点]

08:08.133 --> 08:09.900
[gulps, gargles]
[吞咽，漱口]

08:09.900 --> 08:11.433
[swallows, coughs]
[吞咽，咳嗽]

08:11.433 --> 08:13.233
Hi-ya!
嗨呀！

08:15.267 --> 08:17.400
Huh.
呵呵。

08:17.400 --> 08:18.400
Hi.
你好。

08:18.400 --> 08:20.600
Huh?
Boink.
啊？
操。

08:20.600 --> 08:21.767
Oh, what was I doing now?
哦，我现在在做什么？

08:21.767 --> 08:24.900
[screaming]
[gasping]
[尖叫]
[喘气]

08:24.900 --> 08:26.467
[crashing, grunting]
[崩溃，咕噜声]

08:26.467 --> 08:27.800
- Hm.
- Mr. Krabs!
- 嗯。
- 蟹老板！

08:27.800 --> 08:28.900
You're alive!
你还活着！

08:28.900 --> 08:30.733
Oh, welcome back, Captain!
哦，欢迎回来，船长！

08:30.733 --> 08:32.667
- Haven't you
forgotten something?
- 你没有吗
忘记了什么？

08:32.667 --> 08:34.800
I am not captain anymore.
我不再是队长了。

08:34.800 --> 08:36.467
Squidward is.
章鱼哥是。

08:36.467 --> 08:37.900
- Uh-uh.
The monster ate him.
- 呃呃。
怪物吃了他。

08:37.900 --> 08:40.333
We need a captain,
and that's you!
我们需要一位队长，
那就是你！

08:40.333 --> 08:41.433
Isn't that right?
是不是这样？

08:41.433 --> 08:43.867
[all agreeing]
[全部同意]

08:43.867 --> 08:45.567
- Why would I want
to be captain
- 为什么我想要
当队长

08:45.567 --> 08:48.067
to such a sorry bunch
of lubbers?
致这群令人遗憾的人
笨蛋？

08:48.067 --> 08:50.167
I'm through.
[roaring, glass shatters]
我已经结束了
[咆哮，玻璃碎裂]

08:50.167 --> 08:52.067
- And that's coming out
of your pay!
- 那就要出来了
你的工资！

08:52.067 --> 08:53.700
- Mr. Krabs,
this job calls for
- 蟹老板先生，
这项工作需要

08:53.700 --> 08:55.567
a dictator like you!
像你这样的独裁者！

08:55.567 --> 08:56.933
- Hm.
[roaring, glass shatters]
- 嗯。
[咆哮，玻璃碎裂]

08:56.933 --> 08:58.833
- Do something,
Mr. Krabs!
- 做点什么，
蟹老板！

08:58.833 --> 09:01.600
- Beg me.
[all begging]
- 求我吧。
[大家都在乞讨]

09:01.600 --> 09:02.800
- We're begging.
Please!
- 我们在乞求。
请！

09:02.800 --> 09:05.700
[growling, slurping]
[咆哮，吸食]

09:05.700 --> 09:09.767
- Not buying it.
[all begging]
- 不买。
[大家都在乞讨]

09:09.767 --> 09:11.233
[shimmering tone]
[闪烁的音调]

09:12.367 --> 09:14.067
- Got it!
- 知道了！

09:14.067 --> 09:16.200
Do you know
what this is, Mr. Krabs?
你知道吗
蟹老板，这是什么？

09:16.200 --> 09:18.133
- I don't care.
- It's the first dime
- 我不在乎。
- 这是第一毛钱

09:18.133 --> 09:20.067
you ever earned,
and I'm going to tear it up
你曾经赚到的，
我要把它撕碎

09:20.067 --> 09:21.333
if you don't go back
to being
如果你不回去
存在

09:21.333 --> 09:22.500
the meanie we need.
我们需要的吝啬鬼。

09:22.500 --> 09:25.067
- I said I don't care.
- 我说我不在乎。

09:25.067 --> 09:26.867
- Okay, here goes.
- 好的，开始了。

09:26.867 --> 09:28.700
[straining effort]
[用力]

09:28.700 --> 09:30.333
Ah.
Ahh, wah!
啊。
啊，哇！

09:30.333 --> 09:31.700
[metal clangs, shatters]
[金属叮当作响，破碎]

09:31.700 --> 09:34.300
Ah.
啊。

09:34.300 --> 09:36.367
[saw buzzes]
[看到嗡嗡声]

09:36.367 --> 09:37.633
- My leg!
- 我的腿！

09:37.633 --> 09:39.533
- Ha, you lose.
- 哈，你输了。

09:39.533 --> 09:41.067
- Hm.
Oh!
- 嗯。
哦！

09:41.067 --> 09:42.967
Well then, I'm gonna do
the worst thing
那么，我要做
最糟糕的事情

09:42.967 --> 09:44.700
I can do
to your old dime.
我可以做
到你的旧一角钱。

09:44.700 --> 09:47.633
- Oh, yeah?
What's that?
- 哦，是吗？
那是什么？

09:47.633 --> 09:49.167
- Spend it.
- 花掉它。

09:49.167 --> 09:51.300
[metal clangs]
- Huh?
[金属叮当声]
- 啊？

09:51.300 --> 09:52.800
Hmm.
唔。

09:52.800 --> 09:55.067
Oh, no you don't!
Come here!
哦，不，你不！
过来！

09:55.067 --> 09:56.300
Gah!
[thud]
嘎！
[砰]

09:56.300 --> 09:59.667
All right, everybody!
What am I?
好吧，大家！
我是什么？

09:59.667 --> 10:01.867
all: Um--
[glass shatters]
全体：嗯——
[玻璃碎裂]

10:01.867 --> 10:05.567
- Come on.
It starts with a T.
- 快点。
它以 T 开头。

10:05.567 --> 10:07.267
- A tree?
- 一棵树？

10:07.267 --> 10:08.867
- A teddy bear?
- 泰迪熊？

10:08.867 --> 10:09.867
- A tuba?
- 大号？

10:09.867 --> 10:11.933
- You're a tyrant?
- 你是暴君？

10:11.933 --> 10:14.233
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

10:14.233 --> 10:17.367
all: A tyrant!
[cheering]
全体：暴君！
[欢呼]

10:17.367 --> 10:19.933
- Correct!
All right, I'll save ya.
- 正确的！
好吧，我来救你。

10:19.933 --> 10:22.667
But you've got to promise
to spend most of your--
但你必须保证
花费你的大部分时间——

10:22.667 --> 10:25.933
all of your money right
here, got it?
你所有的钱都对
在这里，明白了吗？

10:25.933 --> 10:27.733
[all agreeing]
[全部同意]

10:27.733 --> 10:30.367
[roars]
[screaming]
[怒吼]
[尖叫]

10:30.367 --> 10:32.700
- Hold onto me dime,
boy-o.
- 抓住我一毛钱，
男孩-o。

10:32.700 --> 10:33.700
[growls]
[咆哮]

10:33.700 --> 10:35.100
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:35.100 --> 10:36.233
[growls]
[咆哮]

10:38.467 --> 10:40.000
[screaming stops]
[尖叫声停止]

10:41.500 --> 10:43.300
- Well, that was
anticlimactic.
- 嗯，那是
虎头蛇尾。

10:43.300 --> 10:44.433
- Again.
- 再次。

10:44.433 --> 10:45.967
[grumbling]
- Ho!
[抱怨]
- 嗬！

10:45.967 --> 10:48.767
Ah, ah, ugh, ah!
[punching]
啊啊啊啊啊！
[冲孔]

10:48.767 --> 10:49.967
[vomits]
[呕吐]

10:49.967 --> 10:51.967
[shivering, whimpering]
[颤抖，呜咽]

10:51.967 --> 10:54.233
Ahh!
[cries]
啊！
[哭声]

10:54.233 --> 10:56.433
- Oh, ah--
[punching, straining]
- 哦，啊--
[猛击、用力]

10:56.433 --> 10:57.600
Oh!
哦！

10:57.600 --> 10:59.167
Whoa!
哇！

10:59.167 --> 11:00.300
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:00.300 --> 11:01.833
[punching]
[冲孔]

11:01.833 --> 11:02.967
Beg to me.
求我吧。

11:02.967 --> 11:05.400
[all exclaiming]
[所有人惊呼]

11:05.400 --> 11:07.367
Whoa!
哇！

11:07.367 --> 11:09.833
Oh!
哦！

11:09.833 --> 11:10.833
[growls]
Oh!
[咆哮]
哦！

11:10.833 --> 11:12.233
Ouch!
Oh!
哎哟!
哦！

11:12.233 --> 11:14.333
Wait a minute!
Gimme that!
等一下！
给我那个！

11:14.333 --> 11:16.133
[bashes]
[重击]

11:16.133 --> 11:18.367
[smashing]
[yells, growls]
[粉碎]
[喊叫，咆哮]

11:18.367 --> 11:21.467
[crashing, squealing]
[撞击声、尖叫声]

11:21.467 --> 11:23.400
[all cheer]
[大家欢呼]

11:23.400 --> 11:24.500
[bubbles popping]
[气泡破裂]

11:24.500 --> 11:27.067
- Here ya go, Mr. Krabs.
You earned it.
- 给你，蟹老板。
你赚到了。

11:27.067 --> 11:29.700
- Well, boy-o,
you believed in me,
- 好吧，男孩，
你相信我，

11:29.700 --> 11:33.233
so today will be
a pay day for you.
所以今天将是
你的发薪日。

11:33.233 --> 11:34.667
- What about me?
- 关于我的什么？

11:34.667 --> 11:36.933
- You,
Ex-Captain Squidward,
- 你，
前章鱼哥船长，

11:36.933 --> 11:40.700
have gone from pay day
to Mayday!
已经从发薪日过去了
到五月天！

11:40.700 --> 11:43.333
Mush!
Every last one of ya!
糊涂！
你们的每一个最后！

11:43.333 --> 11:46.400
All the way
back to Bikini Bottom!
一路走来
回到比基尼泳裤！

11:46.400 --> 11:47.733
[laughs]
[笑]

[笑]